WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
[Rain pouring against metallic rooftops of Neo-Tokyo Sector 9]

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:10.800
Ren: The neural dampeners are failing. My organic memories are leaking through the encryption.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Kageyama: Stay focused, Ren. Corporate hunters just tripped the perimeter subnet.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:25.500
Syndicate Enforcer: Drop the plasma katana. You belong to the Arkham Corporation now!

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:31.000
Ren: “You cannot sever what has already been encoded into the rain...”

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:36.000
[Plasma blade hums with intense violet energy - Crimson spark erupts]

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.800
Ren: Disconnecting mainframe node 04. Overriding system lockdown.

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:55.000
Kageyama: The rift is opening. We move at midnight.
